---
description: Use Notra MCP tools and skills when generating or managing changelogs, brand voice, writing skills, schedules, or GEO visibility.
alwaysApply: false
---

When the user asks about Notra, changelogs from GitHub activity, brand voice, reusable writing skills, or GEO visibility:

1. Prefer the connected Notra MCP server over inventing REST calls.
2. Follow the `notra` skill, then the matching specialized skill.
3. Confirm before destructive or billed actions (delete, publish, GEO scans, sequence runs, content briefs).
4. Never commit API keys or GitHub tokens. Store them only in plugin config or `NOTRA_API_KEY`.
5. Keep generated drafts as `draft` until the user asks to publish.
6. Fetch current docs from https://docs.usenotra.com/llms.txt when behavior is unclear.
